# 统一换行符策略：文本文件一律 LF（项目部署目标为 Linux）
# Windows 下 core.autocrlf=true 会让 git archive 导出 CRLF，导致服务器 bash 报 $'\r' 错误
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确二进制文件不做任何转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.tar.gz binary
